        },
        "subject": "LU-20076 target: sync before waiting for exports at umount",
        "message": "LU-20076 target: sync before waiting for exports at umount\n\nLast_rcvd commit callbacks hold a reference on their export\nuntil the transaction commits. A client that connected or\ndisconnected shortly before the target is stopped leaves such a\ncallback pending, and obd_exports_barrier() then waits for the\nnext periodic journal commit, about 5 seconds, before the\nexport goes away. Test scripts that mount and unmount targets\nover and over, conf-sanity most of all, pay this on nearly every\ntarget unmount.\n\nSync the bottom device in mdt_fini() and ofd_fini() before\nwaiting for the exports. On a test cluster the barrier wait\ndrops from 5 or 6 seconds to 0, and an OST unmount from about 6\nseconds to 0.1.\n\nTest-Parameters: trivial testlist=conf-sanity\nTest-Parameters: testlist=replay-single,recovery-small\nAssisted-by: ClaudeCode:claude-opus-5-5\nSigned-off-by: Patrick Farrell <patrick@thelustrecollective.com>\nChange-Id: I644386e2a24c23f1df48ec19ddb10397646ce6ad\n"
      },
      "branch": "refs/heads/master"
    }
